      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T13:40:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What else do we need an MMIO allocator for? Does it have the same constraints as these PCI BARs (i.e. 32-bit addresses, sizes always a power of two, alignment must match size)? I\u0027d rather not generalise this until we need to, and until we know what else we actually want to use it for.",
