      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T13:40:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`buddy_system_allocator::Heap` uses an intrusive linked list, so only works with writable memory. `buddy_system_allocator::FrameAllocator` doesn\u0027t allow alignment to be specified, which PCI BARs require. I\u0027ll have a look at sending a PR to fix the latter.",
